      <name>Text Forecast</name>
        <text>Cloudy, with a high near 83. Light and variable wind becoming southwest 5 to 10 mph in the afternoon. </text>
        <text>Showers, mainly after 11pm. The rain could be heavy at times.  Low around 66. Northwest wind 5 to 15 mph becoming north after midnight. Winds could gust as high as 20 mph.  Chance of precipitation is 80%. New precipitation amounts between three quarters and one inch possible. </text>
        <text>Showers, mainly before 11am. The rain could be heavy at times.  High near 72. Southwest wind 10 to 15 mph, with gusts as high as 25 mph.  Chance of precipitation is 80%. New precipitation amounts between a quarter and half of an inch possible. </text>
        <text>Showers likely, mainly after 11pm.  Cloudy, with a low around 62. Southwest wind 5 to 10 mph.  Chance of precipitation is 70%. New precipitation amounts of less than a tenth of an inch possible. </text>
        <text>Showers, mainly before 11am.  High near 70. Light and variable wind becoming west 5 to 10 mph in the morning.  Chance of precipitation is 80%. New precipitation amounts of less than a tenth of an inch possible. </text>
        <text>Showers likely.  Mostly cloudy, with a low around 57. Chance of precipitation is 60%.</text>
        <text>A slight chance of showers before 11am.  Mostly sunny, with a high near 72. Chance of precipitation is 20%.</text>
